[{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0009","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-4764","title":"Joomla! eXtplorer 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 eXtplorer 组件（com_extplorer）2.0.0 RC2 及更早版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 show_error 动作中的 dir 参数传递包含 ..（点点）的恶意路径，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用复杂度低，影响大量使用该组件的 Joomla! 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2008-4764"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2008-10-28T02:03:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:58:29Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 com_extplorer 组件，该扩展已停止维护不再有安全更新。若必须使用，升级至已修复目录遍历漏洞的最新版本；在 .htaccess 中添加 `RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} (\\.\\./|%2e%2e%2f)` 过滤 `dir` 参数中的 `../` 序列；配置 Web 服务器禁止组件目录的对外访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28764","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41873","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/5435","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-4764.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2008/CVE-2008-4764.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-4764.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b5bb884a1dbb91134673e92ed8e62094db574f9/cves/2008/4xxx/CVE-2008-4764.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2008-4764-1373.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2008-4764-1372.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2008-4764_28.yaml","https://github.com/0xelixer/Custom-tools/blob/5a8a731d0d786ba39fea598b3f40f8a8e845d482/priv/CVE-2008-4764.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Feb/09/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/foreztgump/cve_json/blob/b5f345eafeb97dce3fe03de3869b187e0574a5c0/2008/CVE-2008-4764.json","https://github.com/merlinepedra/nuclei-templates-1/blob/e218b90ed2c21978e92668478a9f1cc47b268f72/cves/2008/CVE-2008-4764.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0077","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-4250","title":"Microsoft Windows Server 服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Server 服务在处理 RPC 请求的路径规范化过程中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 445 端口发送特制 RPC 报文触发该漏洞，导致系统内存破坏从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 SP4、XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP1/SP2、Vista、Server 2008 及 7 Pre-Beta 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。2008 年 10 月已在野外被 Gimmiv.A 蠕虫大规模利用，微软已通过安全公告 MS08-067 修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-4250"],"sources":["kev","cve"],"published":"2008-10-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2008 年 10 月安全更新 MS08-067 (KB958644)，可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update 自动获取更新。对于无法立即安装补丁的系统，在防火墙层面阻止 TCP 端口 139 和 445 的入站流量，并在不需要 Server 服务的系统上禁用该服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2008/ms08-067","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2008-4250","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/7104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/7132","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40279","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/46040","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0008","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-4668","title":"Joomla! Image Browser 目录遍历漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Joomla! 的 Image Browser（com_imagebrowser）组件 0.1.5 rc2 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 index.php 的 folder 参数中插入 `../` 路径遍历序列，实现包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞影响运行 Joomla! 并安装该组件的系统，CVSS 评分 9.0，危害等级高，攻击者可利用此漏洞读取敏感信息或在特定条件下执行任意代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2008-4668"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2008-10-22T10:30:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:58:16Z","remediation":"立即在 Joomla! 后台卸载并删除 com_imagebrowser 0.1.5 rc2 组件（该组件已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁）。若必须保留，在网站根目录 .htaccess 中添加 RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} folder=\\.\\.(/) [NC] 并 RewriteRule 返回 403 阻断目录遍历攻击；同时在 PHP 层对 $_GET['folder'] 做白名单校验，拒绝包含 .. 或 / 开头的路径输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securityreason.com/securityalert/4464","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/31458","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/45490","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6618","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-4668.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2008/CVE-2008-4668.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-4668.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b5bb884a1dbb91134673e92ed8e62094db574f9/cves/2008/4xxx/CVE-2008-4668.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2008-4668-1367.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2008-4668.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2008-4668_46.yaml","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x32000/31458/info.html","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2008-4668_2.yaml","https://github.com/elijah-bennett0/IntentLimit/blob/bcfe225cf61ee454aa53896f7f3120246f52119f/tools/exploitation/CrazyIngrate/exploits/cve_2008_4668/cve_2008_4668.py","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/26/Reports/lfiReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0004","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1547","title":"Microsoft Outlook Web Access for Exchange Server 2003 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook Web Access（OWA）for Exchange Server 2003 SP2 的 exchweb/bin/redir.asp 页面存在开放重定向漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 URL 参数传入恶意构造的链接，诱使用户点击后跳转到任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Exchange Server 2003 SP2（build 6.5.7638），CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。此类重定向漏洞可被用于窃取用户凭据或传播恶意软件，建议用户升级至受支持版本或安装相应安全更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1547"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2008-10-21T01:18:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:51:57Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Exchange Server 2003 SP2 升级到受支持的 Exchange Server 2016/2019 或迁移至 Exchange Online，以彻底消除此漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 IIS 中对 exchweb/bin/redir.asp 添加 URL 重写规则，过滤并阻断非白名单域名的 URL 参数传递，或直接禁用 redir.asp 页面（通过 IIS 删除该文件处理映射）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securityreason.com/securityalert/4441","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/497374/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/497390/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/497433/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/497500/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/497534/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/31765","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/46061","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32489","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-1547.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2008/CVE-2008-1547.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/bba0a48d3746c10d09d381193c6f11ed1cfdb9ad/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-1547.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b5bb884a1dbb91134673e92ed8e62094db574f9/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1547.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2008-1547_6_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2008-1547_4.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5137a2fdc09885ac43f2e168868a96a399db1177/2008/CVE-2008-1547.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2008/CVE-2008-1547.rules","https://github.com/Yuy0ung/devsecops-platform/blob/cfbe213dd3cba9e1005e92ba7822bfd30e65f5c0/engines/dast-engine/poc/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-1547.yaml","https://github.com/abh2technology/abh2-custom-templates-nucleiengine/blob/c7ba146f8016161974a9cf9f812ae7f225d23065/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-1547.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/f2d12f176efdb99f18928b2678d34b7fa4f530f8/content/CVE-2008-1547.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0066","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-4128","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP Administration 跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"思科 IOS 12.4 系统在 871 集成服务路由器上的 HTTP 管理组件存在多处理跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制 HTTP 请求，诱使已认证的管理员在不知情的情况下访问恶意页面，从而以管理员权限执行任意命令，如通过 /level/15/exec/- 路径执行特权命令。该漏洞影响 Cisco 871 系列路由器，需结合社会工程学诱导目标管理员触发，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。思科已发布安全公告建议用户限制管理访问来源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-4128"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2008-09-18T20:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T05:16:15Z","remediation":"升级到不受此漏洞影响的 Cisco IOS 版本（如 15.x 系列），或迁移至支持的安全版本。如无法升级，在路由器上禁用 HTTP 管理服务（no ip http server），改用 HTTPS 管理（ip http secure-server）并配置 ACL 限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问。同时启用 AAA 认证和命令授权（aaa new-model），防止未授权命令执行。Cisco IOS 12.4 已停止支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jbrownsec.blogspot.com/2008/09/cisco-0day-released.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/31218","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/45226","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6476","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6477","https://media.defense.gov/2026/Jul/09/2003959498/-1/-1/1/CSA_IMPROVE_ROUTER_HYGIENE.PDF","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2008-4128","https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/obsolete/ios-nx-os-software/cisco-ios-software-releases-12-4-mainline.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2008/CVE-2008-4128.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2008/4xxx/CVE-2008-4128.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-4128","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2008/4xxx/CVE-2008-4128.json","https://github.com/Fu-LLC/CyberFlipper/blob/907c81a4f062e8b8f58fe15af95dc6e69992e64c/badusb/CVE_Daily/2026-07-13/CVE-2008-4128_NETWORK.txt","https://github.com/ryansketch01/archimedes/blob/09b1edd22ccef859bf6a85b677d0f6f49edbd6bf/threats/raw-signal/raw-2026-07-13-pm-003-cisa-kev-add-cve-2008-4128-cisco-ios-12-4-csrf.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2008/CVE-2008-4128.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2008/CVE-2008-4128.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/SSVC/data/2008/CVE-2008-4128.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/fdc85fda51ce30c8d5596698e5c36e14d548cfe1/2026/07/2026-07-15-report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2008/POC-AVE-2008-0066.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2008/EXP-AVE-2008-0066.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0055","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-3431","title":"Sun xVM VirtualBox 权限提升漏洞","description":"Sun xVM VirtualBox 1.6.4 之前版本的 VBoxDrv.sys 驱动中 VBoxDrvNtDeviceControl 函数对 IOCTL 使用了 METHOD_NEITHER 通信方式，且未正确验证 Irp 对象关联的内核地址缓冲区，导致本地攻击者可通过打开 \\\\.\\VBoxDrv 设备并调用 DeviceIoControl 发送精心构造的内核地址触发漏洞，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，影响所有 1.6.4 以下版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-3431"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2008-08-05T19:41:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:55:48Z","remediation":"升级 Sun xVM VirtualBox 至 1.6.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 VBoxDrv.sys 驱动中对 IOCTL 缓冲区验证不足的问题。若无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 \\\\.\\VBoxDrv 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/31361","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/4107","http://securitytracker.com/id?1020625","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-66-240095-1","http://virtualbox.org/wiki/Changelog","http://www.coresecurity.com/content/virtualbox-privilege-escalation-vulnerability","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/495095/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/30481","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/2293","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/44202","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/6218","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2008-3431","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2008/CVE-2008-3431.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2008/3xxx/CVE-2008-3431.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-3431","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2008/3xxx/CVE-2008-3431.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2008/CVE-2008-3431/README_KO.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2008-3431.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2008-3431.html","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/dos-poc/6574.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2008-3431"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0007","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-2650","title":"CMSimple 3.1 本地文件包含与任意文件上传漏洞","description":"CMSimple 3.1 存在目录遍历漏洞，当 PHP 的 register_globals 选项开启时，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 sl 参数传递 `../` 路径序列实现任意本地文件包含与执行。攻击者可先包含 adm.php 文件，再通过上传功能进一步实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 CMSimple 3.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。厂商已于 2008 年 6 月发布修补版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-2650"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2008-06-10T18:32:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:54:10Z","remediation":"CMSimple 已针对 3.1 版本发布了安全补丁，应立即升级至修补后的 3.1 版本（版本号未变但已修复）。同时强制关闭 PHP `register_globals` 选项（在 php.ini 中设置 `register_globals = Off`），并对用户输入 `sl` 参数进行严格的路径过滤，禁止包含 `../` 等路径遍历字符。如该 CMS 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他仍在安全更新的内容管理系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/45881","http://secunia.com/advisories/30463","http://www.cmsimple.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=2&t=17","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/29450","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/42792","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/42793","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/5700","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-2650.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2008/CVE-2008-2650.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-2650.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2008-2650-1363.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b5bb884a1dbb91134673e92ed8e62094db574f9/cves/2008/2xxx/CVE-2008-2650.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2008-2650-1358.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2008-2650_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2008-2650_6.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2008-2650-1360.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2008-2650.js","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/Vulnerability-Templates/template2/cve-2008-2650-1361.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0006","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-2398","title":"AppServ Open Project 2.5.10 跨站脚本漏洞（XSS）","description":"AppServ Open Project 2.5.10 及更早版本的 index.php 中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可向 appservlang 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证或实施钓鱼攻击。攻击无需认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制链接即可触发，影响使用 AppServ 搭建的 Web 应用环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-2398"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2008-05-21T13:24:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:53:42Z","remediation":"AppServ 官方已停止维护该项目，建议用户迁移至其他活跃维护的 Web 服务器集成环境（如 XAMPP、WampServer）。如仍需继续使用，应在 index.php 中对 appservlang 参数进行严格的 HTML 编码过滤，使用 htmlspecialchars() 函数处理用户输入；同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 <script>、onerror、onload 等 XSS 特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/30333","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/3896","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/492271/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/29291","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/42546","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31808","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2008-2398"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0005","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-2052","title":"Bitrix Site Manager 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Bitrix Site Manager 6.5 的 redirect.php 中存在开放重定向漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 goto 参数传入恶意 URL，诱骗用户访问钓鱼网站或恶意站点。该漏洞属于 CWE-601 类型，无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者可通过社会工程手段诱导用户点击特制链接实现跳转劫持。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危，影响使用 Bitrix Site Manager 6.5 的所有 Web 应用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2008-2052"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2008-05-02T17:05:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:53:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Bitrix Site Manager 6.5.2 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，修改 redirect.php 对 goto 参数做白名单校验，仅允许跳转到本站域名或预定义的合法外部 URL，拒绝除 http(s) 外的协议并过滤空协议链接；同时可在 web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 Nginx）限制 redirect.php 仅接收本站 Referer 来源的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://holisticinfosec.org/content/view/62/45/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/42157","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-2052.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-2052.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b5bb884a1dbb91134673e92ed8e62094db574f9/cves/2008/2xxx/CVE-2008-2052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-2052","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/c0901c5feaea7671258580515c5866cd13c6b804/reports/http/cves/2008/CVE-2008-2052.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/f29605a96fd1261602d83e1b34d001cc853a7340/nvdcve/CVE-2008-2052.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/f2d12f176efdb99f18928b2678d34b7fa4f530f8/content/CVE-2008-2052.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_122300_122400.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-601.txt","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5137a2fdc09885ac43f2e168868a96a399db1177/2008/CVE-2008-2052.json","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/b732e785d1cd1152a278ca70c0e5b560d3f93531/data/lists/VulnCheck-KEV-List.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0037","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1769","title":"VLC Media Player Cinepak 解码器越界访问内存破坏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"VLC Media Player 0.8.6f 之前的版本存在 Cinepak 视频解码器内存越界访问漏洞。攻击者可构造包含异常数据的恶意 Cinepak 格式视频文件，当用户使用 VLC 播放该文件时，解码器在处理过程中会触发数组越界访问，导致内存破坏，进而引发程序崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可触发，攻击者可通过网页投递或文件共享方式向目标用户发送恶意文件。受影响版本包括 Linux、Windows 和 Mac 平台上的 VLC Media Player，用户应升级至 0.8.6f 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1769"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-25T06:05:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:52:27Z","remediation":"将 VLC Media Player 升级至 0.8.6f 或更高版本。可通过 VLC 官网 https://www.videolan.org/vlc/ 下载最新稳定版进行覆盖安装。若使用 Linux 发行版，可执行 sudo apt-get upgrade vlc（Debian/Ubuntu）或 sudo yum update vlc（RHEL/CentOS）完成升级。对于无法立即升级的环境，建议避免打开来源不明的 .avi/.cpk 等可能包含 Cinepak 编码的视频文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.gentoo.org/show_bug.cgi?id=214627#c3","http://git.videolan.org/gitweb.cgi/vlc.git/?a=commit%3Bh=cf489d7bff3c1b36b2d5501ecf21129c78104d98","http://secunia.com/advisories/29503","http://secunia.com/advisories/29800","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200804-25.xml","http://wiki.videolan.org/Changelog/0.8.6f","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28904","http://www.videolan.org/developers/vlc/NEWS","http://www.videolan.org/security/sa0803.php","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/0985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14445","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/5498","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1769.json","https://github.com/videolan/vlc/blob/dd96e659eef321fd750761a4a4edef3294057c70/NEWS","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1769","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1769.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mxxw-w2hq-pvjj/GHSA-mxxw-w2hq-pvjj.json","https://github.com/mjrgh/PinballY/blob/d84763e32f089317db405798d83ea26f77a18606/VLC64/NEWS.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1769.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2008/CVE-2008-1769","https://github.com/TencentCloud/O266player/blob/a24f92abf4d4f7a90bbb8d3106d02398bd5ed2ab/NEWS","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/debian_DSA-1819.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0036","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1768","title":"VideoLAN VLC 整数溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"VLC Media Player 在 0.8.6f 之前版本中存在多处整数溢出漏洞，漏洞原理在于 MP4 解复用器、Real 解复用器及 Cinepak 编解码器在处理特制媒体文件时，因整数运算溢出导致缓冲区边界计算错误，进而触发缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送或诱使其打开包含恶意构造数据的 MP4、Real 或 Cinepak 媒体文件，利用该漏洞导致 VLC 崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 VLC 的 Windows、Linux 及 macOS 系统用户，攻击条件简单，仅需用户播放恶意媒体文件即可触发，无需复杂交互。VideoLAN 已在 0.8.6f 版本中修复该漏洞，用户应升级至最新版本以消除安全隐患。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1768"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-25T06:05:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:52:27Z","remediation":"立即将 VLC Media Player 升级至 0.8.6f 或更高版本。Debian/Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt-get install --only-upgrade vlc 完成升级；Intrepid (8.10) 及之后版本不受影响。若无法立即升级，可从 VideoLAN 官网下载最新稳定版覆盖安装。对于使用旧版发行版（如 Dapper/Feisty/Gutsy）的系统，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统版本以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29503","http://secunia.com/advisories/29800","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200804-25.xml","http://wiki.videolan.org/Changelog/0.8.6f","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28903","http://www.videolan.org/developers/vlc/NEWS","http://www.videolan.org/security/sa0803.php","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/0985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14412","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1768.json","https://github.com/videolan/vlc/blob/dd96e659eef321fd750761a4a4edef3294057c70/NEWS","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1768","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1768.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2008-1768","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1768.json","https://github.com/sunqueen/vlc-2.2.1.32-2013/blob/94a7e1c8b5afec3bfad2b6c9c062708a857c8a75/Debug/vlc/NEWS.txt","https://github.com/TencentCloud/O266player/blob/a24f92abf4d4f7a90bbb8d3106d02398bd5ed2ab/NEWS","https://github.com/starfive-tech/Debian/blob/b4670f9b133a360d342c642310ec0a8d91106b23/vlc/debian/changelog","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/debian_DSA-1819.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0019","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-0320","title":"OpenOffice.org OpenOffice OLE导入器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org 2.4 及之前版本的 OLE 导入器存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含恶意构造的 DocumentSummaryInformation 流的 OLE 文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务（应用程序崩溃）甚至任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 OpenOffice.org 2.4 之前的所有版本（≤2.3.1），CVSS 评分 9.3（严重），攻击向量为网络，需用户交互（中等攻击复杂度），无需认证即可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。攻击者可构造恶意 OLE 文档诱导受害者打开，利用 OLE 导入器处理 DocumentSummaryInformation 流时的堆溢出实现远程代码执行。该漏洞已在 OpenOffice.org 2.4 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-0320"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-17T19:05:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:49:23Z","remediation":"升级 Apache OpenOffice 至 2.4 或更高版本（可通过 https://www.openoffice.org/download/ 获取最新版本），以修复 OLE 导入器中基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。官方安全公告明确指出无临时缓解措施，因此必须升级。如在生产环境暂时无法升级，建议在邮件网关和防火墙层面过滤 .doc/.xls/.ppt 等含 OLE 对象的文件，并禁止打开来源不明的 Office 文档，同时启用操作系统 DEP（数据执行防护）等内存保护机制降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=694","http://secunia.com/advisories/29844","http://secunia.com/advisories/29852","http://secunia.com/advisories/29864","http://secunia.com/advisories/29871","http://secunia.com/advisories/29910","http://secunia.com/advisories/29913","http://secunia.com/advisories/29987","http://secunia.com/advisories/30100","http://secunia.com/advisories/30179","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200805-16.xml","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-231642-1","http://www.debian.org/security/2008/dsa-1547","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2008:090","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2008:095","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2008_23_openoffice.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/bulletin.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2007-4770.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2007-5745.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2008-0320.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2008-0175.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2008-0176.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28819","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1019890","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/usn-609-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1253/references","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1375/references","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41860","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10318","https://www.redhat.com/archives/fedora-package-announce/2008-April/msg00448.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2008/0xxx/CVE-2008-0320.json","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2008-0320.html","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-0320","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-0320.md","https://github.com/hahwul/mad-metasploit/blob/a718d5e7a95eec2283ab0f8b464649b5cfb191a4/archive/exploits/windows/local/18923.rb","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2008-0320","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-0320.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-56hf-q7h3-4m8c/GHSA-56hf-q7h3-4m8c.json","https://github.com/SunStarSys/orion/blob/845dc4a772afcfef0a471ab5dd3dbc00f5e99397/ooo-trunk/content/security/cves/CVE-2008-0320.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0034","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1382","title":"libpng 代码执行和拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libpng 库在处理 PNG 文件中零长度 \"unknown\" chunks 时存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。攻击者可构造包含零长度未知块的恶意 PNG 文件，诱导受害者使用受影响版本的 libpng 库（1.0.6-1.0.32、1.2.0-1.2.26、1.4.0beta01-1.4.0beta19）的应用程序打开或处理该文件，触发未初始化内存访问导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），甚至可能实现任意代码执行。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意 PNG 文件或通过网页嵌入恶意图片触发漏洞，攻击向量为网络远程攻击，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危）。受影响产品广泛使用 libpng 的图像查看器、浏览器、图像处理软件等。升级至 libpng 1.0.33、1.2.27、1.4.0beta20 或更高版本可修复该漏洞。","severit