程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.8（中等），攻击向量为网络，需用户交互打开恶意文件。攻击者构造畸形 VR 电影文件，利用 obji 原子大小为零触发栈缓冲区溢出，实现任意代码执行。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 中修复此漏洞，用户应升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1022"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.4.5 或更高版本（官方下载：https://support.apple.com/kb/DL837），或通过 Windows“程序和功能”彻底卸载 QuickTime for Windows（Apple 已停止对 Windows 版的安全更新，卸载为最彻底的缓解措施）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019766","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490461/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-019","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41613","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1022","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1022.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8h2c-hq5v-cjxr/GHSA-8h2c-hq5v-cjxr.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/